# c01-absolute-anchor: section 7 C01 (H1/H3/H7) and the section 6.1 absolute anchor
exit ok
frame 625/0/1
digest-anchor
count tickAttempts 0
count suppressedTicks 0
count emittedTickFrames 0
count publicUpdateAttempts 1
count publicUpdateSuccesses 1
count frameCount 1
require host.command index=1 line=3 verb=seek outcome=ok
# NOTE (source line numbers): the task table spelled this as line=2 because it counted the program
# without the header comment that names the case. Section 3.6.1 settles it as the 1-based physical
# source line, counting comments and blank lines, so the open is line 2 and this seek is line 3.
# Confirmed by the host's own record rather than by inference.
# The assertion is load-bearing: the runner rejoins a multi-token require, so a wrong index, line,
# verb or outcome fails the case.
